<% content_for :title, "Request equipment | Mobility Exchange" %><div class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Your next chapter</p><h1>A little support for daily life.</h1><p>Tell us how to reach you. Our team will review your request and confirm availability.</p></div><div class="container form-layout"><div><section class="form-section"><div class="form-section-title"><span>01</span><h2>Your selected equipment</h2></div><div class="record-summary"><%= equipment_illustration(@item.category, @item.equipment_type) %><div><h3><%= @item.name %></h3><p><%= @item.inventory_number %> · <%= @item.pickup_location %></p></div></div></section><section class="form-section"><div class="form-section-title"><span>02</span><h2>Contact & request details</h2></div><%= form_with url: equipment_requests_path do |f| %><%= f.hidden_field :equipment_id, value: @item.id %><%= render "shared/contact_fields" %><div class="notice"><%= design_icon("shield") %><p>Submitting a request does not reserve the item. You will be asked to sign the recipient waiver before booking pickup.</p></div><div class="actions"><%= f.submit "Submit request" %></div><% end %></section></div><aside class="form-sidebar"><%= design_icon("people") %><h3>Every handoff starts with care.</h3><p>Once your request is approved, the team reserves your equipment. Your account will guide you through signing and pickup.</p><h3>Need a little help?</h3><p>Contact the team if you have questions about an item or need assistance with your request.</p><%= link_to page_path("contact"), class: "text-link" do %>Connect with the team <%= design_icon("arrow") %><% end %></aside></div>
